{"ID":"20240118151330-z77upy6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151330-z77upy6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151330-z77upy6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151330-20fybz8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122084734-vkztc5m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122084734-vkztc5m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:86,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:86\u0026#125;","title":"062香蒲","type":"doc","updated":"20240129113847"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151330-20fybz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151330-20fybz8","updated":"20240122084730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主五脏心下邪气，口中烂臭，坚齿明目聪耳，久服轻身耐老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084732-cd1te3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084732-cd1te3c"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】香蒲为生于池沼之宿根草，处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084733-vojeoyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084733-vojeoyu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084737-4v9e1rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084737-4v9e1rx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" 时医多用蒲黄，鲜少用香蒲。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084734-x0b2yvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084734-x0b2yvb"}},{"ID":"20240122084734-gj6oi71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084734-gj6oi71"}},{"ID":"20240122084734-vkztc5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084734-vkztc5m","updated":"20240129113847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第六十二味药，香蒲。香蒲跟蒲黄稍微有点不太一样，我们现在大部分都是用蒲黄，很少用香蒲，这个药诸位知道一下就好了。一般来说蒲黄跟香蒲通通都是活血化瘀的、清热解毒的药，诸位这样子记就可以了。"}]}]}